  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2578bad7-9e1b-5a5b-8b59-c0011c8c6ef5" activityNameId="a0442e3f-620a-5f13-8886-52a1e2fd61d2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Straw, from straw areas, at field</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Straw, from straw areas, at field
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of fresh straw from straw areas with 1.66 kg CO2  and 17.6 MJ per kg dry matter. The dry matter content of fresh straw is about 15%  the density about 120 kg/m3;
Synonyms: bedding, litter, mulch; 
UUID: dc1ea820-ddf4-3b3a-816d-23f5993d5a87
The inventories include the cultivation of straw on a straw area. Included steps are harvest and  loading for transport.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Extensiv organic procduction.
Time period: undefined
Production volume:  
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dc1ea820-ddf4-3b3a-816d-23f5993d5a87.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
